    {
     "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Follow the packet’s <b>stir-fry preparation instructions</b>, stopping while they still have a little firmness.</li><li><b>Drain well and use promptly</b>; they’ll finish cooking in the sauce.</li><li>Avoid fully softening them beforehand or aggressively stirring them in the pan.</li></ul>",
     "title_html": "Noodles first (all three)"
    },
    {
     "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Beyond the basics:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>oyster sauce</li><li>dark soy sauce</li><li>fish sauce</li><li>tamarind purée</li><li>mushrooms</li><li>bok choy</li><li>spring onions</li><li>eggs</li><li>bean sprouts</li><li>roasted peanuts</li><li>lime</li></ul></li><li><b>Bok choy can cover both of the first two dishes</b>, so there’s no need to buy separate greens.</li></ul>",
